An exclusion without an inclusion selects every other account in CLI and API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight accounts --accounts '~*foobar*'

========== API ==========

accounts({ accounts: ['~*foobar*'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:foobar
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Assets:foobar  2 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

Assets:Cash
Equity:Opening

========== API-OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "comment": null,
    "used": true,
    "transactionCount": 1
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========
